{"type":"after","callId":"call@195","endTime":288080.858,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [ref=e1]:\n  - generic [ref=e2]:\n    - generic [ref=e3]:\n      - generic [ref=e4]:\n        - list:\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Product Design\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Experience Design\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Art Direction\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Motion & 3D\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Creative Engineering\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Parametric Systems\n        - generic \"About Alexander narrative\" [ref=e6]:\n          - main [ref=e7]:\n            - region [ref=e8]:\n              - heading \"I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences. At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\" [level=1] [ref=e11]:\n                - generic [ref=e12]: I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences.\n                - generic [ref=e13]: At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\n            - region [ref=e14]:\n              - heading \"It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right. Its shape is still fragmented. This stage of an idea has always captivated me. I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved. Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\" [level=2] [ref=e17]:\n                - generic [ref=e18]: It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right.\n                - generic [ref=e19]: Its shape is still fragmented.\n                - generic [ref=e20]: This stage of an idea has always captivated me.\n                - generic [ref=e21]: I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved.\n                - generic [ref=e22]: Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\n            - region [ref=e23]:\n              - generic [ref=e24]:\n                - heading [level=2] [ref=e25]:\n                  - text: Perhaps that is why I have always been drawn to the space between\n                  - strong [ref=e26]: aesthetics and technology\n                  - text: .\n                - paragraph [ref=e27]:\n                  - text: I studied\n                  - strong [ref=e28]: Communication Design\n                  - text: \", then built my work across digital products, web design, identity, interfaces, motion, and creative uses of\"\n                  - strong [ref=e29]: AI and technology\n                  - text: .\n                - paragraph [ref=e30]:\n                  - text: At the centre of it is\n                  - strong [ref=e31]: curiosity\n                  - text: \":\"\n                  - strong [ref=e32]: how things work\n                  - text: \", how they feel and how those qualities can strengthen one another.\"\n                - paragraph [ref=e33]:\n                  - text: This is what draws me to\n                  - strong [ref=e34]: emerging technology\n                  - text: . I see the opportunity for it to play a useful role in people’s lives once it has been deconstructed,\n                  - strong [ref=e35]: made tangible\n                  - text: \", made visual and\"\n                  - strong [ref=e36]: made interactive\n                  - text: enough to resonate.\n                - paragraph [ref=e37]:\n                  - text: That curiosity has shaped my work with\n                  - strong [ref=e38]: technology start-ups\n                  - text: and\n                  - strong [ref=e39]: creative agencies\n                  - text: \", on\"\n                  - strong [ref=e40]: ambitious projects\n                  - text: across identity, finance, mobility, healthcare and digital products.\n                - list \"Selected clients\" [ref=e41]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e42]: Yoti\n                  - listitem [ref=e43]: S&P Global\n                  - listitem [ref=e44]: Bentley\n                  - listitem [ref=e45]: SunExpress\n                  - listitem [ref=e46]: McCann\n                  - listitem [ref=e47]: American Heart Association\n            - region \"The practice comes into view\" [ref=e48]\n            - region [ref=e49]:\n              - generic [ref=e50]:\n                - heading [level=2] [ref=e51]:\n                  - text: Each brings a\n                  - strong [ref=e52]: different way of thinking\n                  - text: to the work.\n                - paragraph [ref=e53]: Their different perspectives help me understand an opportunity, shape how an experience works, give it character, make behaviour and feeling tangible, and explore directly through code, tools and working systems.\n                - paragraph [ref=e54]: AI runs through all of this as a creative material and a practical capability, expanding what I can explore, generate and build.\n                - paragraph [ref=e55]: Moving between disciplines lets one kind of thinking affect another. An insight can reshape a product. A technical experiment can unlock a visual language. Motion can make an interaction easier to understand.\n            - region [ref=e56]:\n              - heading \"As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere. It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour. It gains a character people can trust. It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel. That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\" [level=2] [ref=e59]:\n                - generic [ref=e60]: As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere.\n                - generic [ref=e61]: It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour.\n                - generic [ref=e62]: It gains a character people can trust.\n                - generic [ref=e63]: It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel.\n                - generic [ref=e64]: That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\n            - region [ref=e65]:\n              - heading [level=2] [ref=e67]:\n                - text: \"That is the work I do with ambitious teams: bringing\"\n                - strong [ref=e68]: design\n                - text: \",\"\n                - strong [ref=e69]: creative technology\n                - text: and\n                - strong [ref=e70]: AI\n                - text: together to give early ideas a form people can understand, trust and want to engage with.\n            - region [ref=e71]:\n              - generic [ref=e73]:\n                - heading \"If you are building something new, let’s talk.\" [level=2] [ref=e74]\n                - group \"Rotate the point-cloud bust horizontally\"\n                - navigation \"Contact Alexander\" [ref=e77]:\n                  - link \"Email\" [ref=e78]:\n                    - /url: mailto:alexander@beck.fyi\n                  - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=e79]:\n                    - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n      - generic:\n        - generic:\n          - generic:\n            - contentinfo:\n              - generic:\n                - group \"Social media links\" [ref=e81]:\n                  - link \"Apple Music\" [ref=e82]:\n                    - /url: https://music.apple.com/profile/beckandeggs\n                    - generic: \n                  - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=e84]:\n                    - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n                    - generic: \n                - generic \"London local time\" [ref=e87]:\n                  - generic [ref=e88]:\n                    - generic [ref=e89]:\n                      - strong [ref=e90]: London\n                      - generic [ref=e91]: ·\n                    - time [ref=e92]: 11:13:40 AM\n            - status:\n              - generic: A London-based design practice shaping products, interfaces, and interactive moments with a clear point of view, so complex ideas feel precise, human, and quietly inevitable. © 2026 Alexander Beck\n      - generic [ref=e93]:\n        - navigation \"Primary buttons\" [ref=e94]:\n          - link \"Home\" [ref=e95]:\n            - /url: /index.html\n            - generic: \n          - link \"Work\" [ref=e97]:\n            - /url: /portfolio.html\n            - text: \n          - link \"About Me\" [ref=e99]:\n            - /url: /about.html\n            - text: \n          - link \"Contact\" [ref=e101]:\n            - /url: /contact.html\n            - text: \n        - group \"Secondary buttons\" [ref=e103]:\n          - button \"Sound off\" [ref=e104]:\n            - generic: \n          - button \"Switch to dark mode\" [ref=e106]\n    - generic:\n      - generic:\n        - progressbar \"About page scroll progress\"\n        - status: Section 4 of 8\n  - region \"About Narrative creative toolkit\":\n    - generic [ref=e112]:\n      - button \"About Narrative Creative toolkit\" [ref=e113]:\n        - generic [ref=e116]: About Narrative\n        - generic [ref=e117]: Creative toolkit\n      - generic [ref=e118]:\n        - button \"Previous Section\" [ref=e119]\n        - button \"Previous keyframe\" [ref=e122]\n        - button \"Play\" [ref=e125]\n        - button \"Next Section\" [ref=e128]\n        - button \"Next keyframe\" [ref=e131]\n        - status [ref=e134]: 7.55 WU\n        - slider \"Global narrative playhead\" [active] [ref=e135]: \"7.55\"\n        - button \"Follow scroll\" [ref=e136]\n        - button \"Live ambient\" [ref=e137]\n        - combobox \"Preview profile\" [ref=e138]:\n          - option \"Desktop\" [selected]\n          - option \"Mobile\"\n          - option \"Reduced motion\"\n      - generic [ref=e139]:\n        - button \"Undo\" [disabled] [ref=e140]: ↶\n        - button \"Redo\" [disabled] [ref=e141]: ↷\n        - button \"Path\" [ref=e142]\n        - button \"Camera\" [ref=e143]\n        - button \"After\" [ref=e144]\n        - group [r