17] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 77% · At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\" [ref=e318] [cursor=pointer]\n            - generic [ref=e319]:\n              - button \"Spatial text at 24% · It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right.\" [ref=e320] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 41% · Its shape is still fragmented.\" [ref=e321] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 57% · This stage of an idea has always captivated me.\" [ref=e322] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 75% · I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved.\" [ref=e323] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 93% · Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\" [ref=e324] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Vertical · 6 blocks\" [ref=e326] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Discipline reveal from 32% to 290%\" [ref=e328] [cursor=pointer]: Discipline reveal\n            - button \"Vertical · 4 blocks\" [ref=e330] [cursor=pointer]\n            - generic [ref=e331]:\n              - button \"Spatial text at 8% · As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere.\" [ref=e332] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 28% · It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour.\" [ref=e333] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 48% · It gains a character people can trust.\" [ref=e334] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 68% · It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel.\" [ref=e335] [cursor=pointer]\n              - button \"Spatial text at 91% · That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\" [ref=e336] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Vertical · 1 blocks\" [ref=e338] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Spatial text at 34% · If you are building something new, let’