{"type":"after","callId":"call@846","endTime":599958.34,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [ref=f2e2]:\n  - generic [ref=f2e3]:\n    - generic [ref=f2e4]:\n      - list:\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Product Design\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Experience Design\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Art Direction\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Motion & 3D\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Creative Engineering\n        - listitem:\n          - generic: Parametric Systems\n      - generic \"About Alexander narrative\" [ref=f2e6]:\n        - main [ref=f2e7]:\n          - region [ref=f2e8]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e10]:\n              - heading \"I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences. At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\" [level=1] [ref=f2e11]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e12]: I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences.\n                - generic [ref=f2e13]: At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\n              - generic: \n          - region [ref=f2e14]:\n            - heading \"It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right. Its shape is still fragmented. This stage of an idea has always captivated me. I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved. Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\" [level=2] [ref=f2e17]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e18]: It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right.\n              - generic [ref=f2e19]: Its shape is still fragmented.\n              - generic [ref=f2e20]: This stage of an idea has always captivated me.\n              - generic [ref=f2e21]: I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved.\n              - generic [ref=f2e22]: Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\n          - region [ref=f2e23]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e24]:\n              - heading [level=2] [ref=f2e25]:\n                - text: Perhaps that is why I have always been drawn to the space between\n                - strong [ref=f2e26]: aesthetics and technology\n                - text: .\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e27]:\n                - text: I studied\n                - strong [ref=f2e28]: Communication Design\n                - text: \", then built my work across digital products, web design, identity, interfaces, motion, and creative uses of\"\n                - strong [ref=f2e29]: AI and technology\n                - text: .\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e30]:\n                - text: At the centre of it is\n                - strong [ref=f2e31]: curiosity\n                - text: \":\"\n                - strong [ref=f2e32]: how things work\n                - text: \", how they feel and how those qualities can strengthen one another.\"\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e33]:\n                - text: This is what draws me to\n                - strong [ref=f2e34]: emerging technology\n                - text: . I see the opportunity for it to play a useful role in people’s lives once it has been deconstructed,\n                - strong [ref=f2e35]: made tangible\n                - text: \", made visual and\"\n                - strong [ref=f2e36]: made interactive\n                - text: enough to resonate.\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e37]:\n                - text: That curiosity has shaped my work with\n                - strong [ref=f2e38]: technology start-ups\n                - text: and\n                - strong [ref=f2e39]: creative agencies\n                - text: \", on\"\n                - strong [ref=f2e40]: ambitious projects\n                - text: across identity, finance, mobility, healthcare and digital products.\n              - list \"Selected clients\" [ref=f2e41]:\n                - listitem [ref=f2e42]: Yoti\n                - listitem [ref=f2e43]: S&P Global\n                - listitem [ref=f2e44]: Bentley\n                - listitem [ref=f2e45]: SunExpress\n                - listitem [ref=f2e46]: McCann\n                - listitem [ref=f2e47]: American Heart Association\n          - region \"The practice comes into view\" [ref=f2e48]\n          - region [ref=f2e49]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e50]:\n              - heading [level=2] [ref=f2e51]:\n                - text: Each brings a\n                - strong [ref=f2e52]: different way of thinking\n                - text: to the work.\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e53]: Their different perspectives help me understand an opportunity, shape how an experience works, give it character, make behaviour and feeling tangible, and explore directly through code, tools and working systems.\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e54]: AI runs through all of this as a creative material and a practical capability, expanding what I can explore, generate and build.\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e55]: Moving between disciplines lets one kind of thinking affect another. An insight can reshape a product. A technical experiment can unlock a visual language. Motion can make an interaction easier to understand.\n          - region [ref=f2e56]:\n            - heading \"As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere. It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour. It gains a character people can trust. It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel. That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\" [level=2] [ref=f2e59]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e60]: As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere.\n              - generic [ref=f2e61]: It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour.\n              - generic [ref=f2e62]: It gains a character people can trust.\n              - generic [ref=f2e63]: It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel.\n              - generic [ref=f2e64]: That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\n          - region [ref=f2e65]:\n            - heading [level=2] [ref=f2e67]:\n              - text: \"That is the work I do with ambitious teams: bringing\"\n              - strong [ref=f2e68]: design\n              - text: \",\"\n              - strong [ref=f2e69]: creative technology\n              - text: and\n              - strong [ref=f2e70]: AI\n              - text: together to give early ideas a form people can understand, trust and want to engage with.\n          - region [ref=f2e71]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e73]:\n              - heading \"If you are building something new, let’s talk.\" [level=2] [ref=f2e74]\n              - group \"Rotate the point-cloud bust horizontally\"\n              - navigation \"Contact Alexander\" [ref=f2e77]:\n                - link \"Email\" [ref=f2e78] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: mailto:alexander@beck.fyi\n                - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=f2e79] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n    - generic:\n      - generic:\n        - generic:\n          - contentinfo:\n            - generic:\n              - group \"Social media links\" [ref=f2e81]:\n                - link \"Apple Music\" [ref=f2e82] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://music.apple.com/profile/beckandeggs\n                  - generic: \n                - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=f2e84] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n                  - generic: \n              - generic \"London local time\" [ref=f2e87]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e88]:\n                  - strong [ref=f2e90]: London\n                  - time [ref=f2e91]: 11:18:53 AM\n          - status:\n            - generic: A London-based design practice shaping products, interfaces, and interactive moments with a clear point of view, so complex ideas feel precise, human, and quietly inevitable. © 2026 Alexander Beck\n    - generic [ref=f2e92]:\n      - navigation \"Primary buttons\" [ref=f2e93]:\n        - link \"Home\" [ref=f2e94] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /index.html\n          - generic: \n        - link \"Work\" [ref=f2e96] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /portfolio.html\n          - text: \n        - link \"About Me\" [ref=f2e98]:\n          - /url: /about.html\n          - text: \n        - link \"Contact\" [ref=f2e100] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /contact.html\n          - text: \n      - group \"Secondary buttons\" [ref=f2e102]:\n        - button \"Sound off\" [ref=f2e103] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - generic: \n  - generic:\n    - generic:\n      - progressbar \"About page scroll progress\"\n      - status: Section 1 of 8"}}
