{"type":"after","callId":"call@1243","endTime":1020780.085,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [active] [ref=f9e1]:\n  - generic [ref=f9e2]:\n    - generic [ref=f9e3]:\n      - generic [ref=f9e4]:\n        - list:\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Product Design\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Experience Design\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Art Direction\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Motion & 3D\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Creative Engineering\n          - listitem:\n            - generic: Parametric Systems\n        - generic \"About Alexander narrative\" [ref=f9e6]:\n          - main [ref=f9e7]:\n            - region [ref=f9e8]:\n              - generic [ref=f9e10]:\n                - heading \"I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences. At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\" [level=1] [ref=f9e11]:\n                  - generic [ref=f9e12]: I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences.\n                  - generic [ref=f9e13]: At the start, an idea can feel like everything at once.\n                - generic: \n            - region [ref=f9e14]:\n              - heading \"It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right. Its shape is still fragmented. This stage of an idea has always captivated me. I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved. Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\" [level=2] [ref=f9e17]:\n                - generic [ref=f9e18]: It has to be useful, original, technically possible and emotionally right.\n                - generic [ref=f9e19]: Its shape is still fragmented.\n                - generic [ref=f9e20]: This stage of an idea has always captivated me.\n                - generic [ref=f9e21]: I learn what is there and what matters to the people involved.\n                - generic [ref=f9e22]: Then I look for the organising thought that can bring it into focus.\n            - region [ref=f9e23]:\n              - generic [ref=f9e24]:\n                - heading [level=2] [ref=f9e25]:\n                  - text: Perhaps that is why I have always been drawn to the space between\n                  - strong [ref=f9e26]: aesthetics and technology\n                  - text: .\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e27]:\n                  - text: I studied\n                  - strong [ref=f9e28]: Communication Design\n                  - text: \", then built my work across digital products, web design, identity, interfaces, motion, and creative uses of\"\n                  - strong [ref=f9e29]: AI and technology\n                  - text: .\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e30]:\n                  - text: At the centre of it is\n                  - strong [ref=f9e31]: curiosity\n                  - text: \":\"\n                  - strong [ref=f9e32]: how things work\n                  - text: \", how they feel and how those qualities can strengthen one another.\"\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e33]:\n                  - text: This is what draws me to\n                  - strong [ref=f9e34]: emerging technology\n                  - text: . I see the opportunity for it to play a useful role in people’s lives once it has been deconstructed,\n                  - strong [ref=f9e35]: made tangible\n                  - text: \", made visual and\"\n                  - strong [ref=f9e36]: made interactive\n                  - text: enough to resonate.\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e37]:\n                  - text: That curiosity has shaped my work with\n                  - strong [ref=f9e38]: technology start-ups\n                  - text: and\n                  - strong [ref=f9e39]: creative agencies\n                  - text: \", on\"\n                  - strong [ref=f9e40]: ambitious projects\n                  - text: across identity, finance, mobility, healthcare and digital products.\n                - list \"Selected clients\" [ref=f9e41]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e42]: Yoti\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e43]: S&P Global\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e44]: Bentley\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e45]: SunExpress\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e46]: McCann\n                  - listitem [ref=f9e47]: American Heart Association\n            - region \"The practice comes into view\" [ref=f9e48]\n            - region [ref=f9e49]:\n              - generic [ref=f9e50]:\n                - heading [level=2] [ref=f9e51]:\n                  - text: Each brings a\n                  - strong [ref=f9e52]: different way of thinking\n                  - text: to the work.\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e53]: Their different perspectives help me understand an opportunity, shape how an experience works, give it character, make behaviour and feeling tangible, and explore directly through code, tools and working systems.\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e54]: AI runs through all of this as a creative material and a practical capability, expanding what I can explore, generate and build.\n                - paragraph [ref=f9e55]: Moving between disciplines lets one kind of thinking affect another. An insight can reshape a product. A technical experiment can unlock a visual language. Motion can make an interaction easier to understand.\n            - region [ref=f9e56]:\n              - heading \"As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere. It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour. It gains a character people can trust. It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel. That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\" [level=2] [ref=f9e59]:\n                - generic [ref=f9e60]: As those ways of thinking begin to influence one another, complexity starts to cohere.\n                - generic [ref=f9e61]: It takes on clear form and intuitive behaviour.\n                - generic [ref=f9e62]: It gains a character people can trust.\n                - generic [ref=f9e63]: It becomes something they can relate to, interact with and feel.\n                - generic [ref=f9e64]: That is what excites me about bringing an idea to life.\n            - region [ref=f9e65]:\n              - heading [level=2] [ref=f9e67]:\n                - text: \"That is the work I do with ambitious teams: bringing\"\n                - strong [ref=f9e68]: design\n                - text: \",\"\n                - strong [ref=f9e69]: creative technology\n                - text: and\n                - strong [ref=f9e70]: AI\n                - text: together to give early ideas a form people can understand, trust and want to engage with.\n            - region [ref=f9e71]:\n              - generic [ref=f9e73]:\n                - heading \"If you are building something new, let’s talk.\" [level=2] [ref=f9e74]\n                - group \"Rotate the point-cloud bust horizontally\"\n                - navigation \"Contact Alexander\" [ref=f9e77]:\n                  - link \"Email\" [ref=f9e78] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: mailto:alexander@beck.fyi\n                  - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=f9e79] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n      - generic:\n        - generic:\n          - generic:\n            - contentinfo:\n              - generic:\n                - group \"Social media links\" [ref=f9e81]:\n                  - link \"Apple Music\" [ref=f9e82] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://music.apple.com/profile/beckandeggs\n                    - generic: \n                  - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=f9e84] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.linkedin.com/in/thisisbeck/\n                    - generic: \n                - generic \"London local time\" [ref=f9e87]:\n                  - generic [ref=f9e88]:\n                    - generic [ref=f9e89]:\n                      - strong [ref=f9e90]: London\n                      - generic [ref=f9e91]: ·\n                    - time [ref=f9e92]: 11:25:54 AM\n            - status:\n              - generic: A London-based design practice shaping products, interfaces, and interactive moments with a clear point of view, so complex ideas feel precise, human, and quietly inevitable. © 2026 Alexander Beck\n      - generic [ref=f9e93]:\n        - navigation \"Primary buttons\" [ref=f9e94]:\n          - link \"Home\" [ref=f9e95] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /index.html\n            - generic: \n          - link \"Work\" [ref=f9e97] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /portfolio.html\n            - text: \n          - link \"About Me\" [ref=f9e99]:\n            - /url: /about.html\n            - text: \n          - link \"Contact\" [ref=f9e101] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /contact.html\n            - text: \n        - group \"Secondary buttons\" [ref=f9e103]:\n          - button \"Sound off\" [ref=f9e104] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - generic: \n          - button \"Switch to dark mode\" [ref=f9e106] [cursor=pointer]\n    - generic:\n      - generic:\n        - progressbar \"About page scroll progress\"\n        - status: Section 1 of 8\n  - region \"About Narrative creative toolkit\":\n    - generic [ref=f9e112]:\n      - button \"About Narrative Creative toolkit\" [ref=f9e113] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - generic [ref=f9e116]: About Narrative\n        - generic [ref=f9e117]: Creative toolkit\n      - generic [ref=f9e118]:\n        - button \"Previous Section\" [ref=f9e119] [cursor=pointer]\n        - button \"Previous keyframe\" [ref=f9e122] [cursor=pointer]\n        - button \"Play\" [ref=f9e125] [cursor=pointer]\n        - button \"Next Section\" [ref=f9e128] [cursor=pointer]\n        - button \"Next keyframe\" [ref=f9e131] [cursor=pointer]\n        - status [ref=f9e134]: 0.00 WU\n        - slider \"Global narrative playhead\" [ref=f9e135]: \"0\"\n  